<title>USA: CKS Group completes acquisition.</title>
<headline>CKS Group completes acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>CUPERTINO, Calif. 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>CKS Group Inc on Thursday said it has completed its acquisition of  Prisma Holding GmbH, a privately-held new media marketing and communications firm based in Hamburg, Germany.</p>
<p>CKS Group paid $6.5 million in cash and common stock as initial consideration. It will pay up to an additional $10 million in cash and common stock if certain operating results are achieved in 1997, 1998 and 1999.</p>
<p>Prisma has become a wholly-owned unit of CKS Group, and it will operate under the name CKS Europe.</p>
</text>
